HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
Server: nginx/1.26.0
Date: <ts>
Connection: close
Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache
Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, POST, OPTIONS
